      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? that sounds so scary. i thought it was just the heat/swelling. are you sure it's serious? i'm kinda broke right now and an ER visit is gonna cost a fortune. can i just take some ibuprofen and rest for a couple days to see if the swelling goes down first?",
