      "content": "okay okay i hear you. i'm just really overwhelmed. honestly i don't think it's that bad since i feel okay otherwise... no real headache or anything, just the swelling and the lights. if i promise to monitor it closely and just stay off my feet for the rest of the week, can i wait until my doctor's office opens on monday morning? i really dont want to deal with the hospital tonight if i can help it.",
